# shadcn/ui (PharmLMS)

## Components

- Prefer primitives from `@/components/ui/*` over raw HTML elements.
- Use `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` for conditional classes.
- Follow CVA patterns in existing ui components (e.g. `buttonVariants`).
- App dashboard shells use `SidebarProvider`, `Sidebar`, `SidebarInset` from `@/components/ui/sidebar`.

## Styling

- Use semantic Tailwind tokens: `bg-primary`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`, `bg-sidebar`.
- Do not hardcode hex colors in new code — use CSS variables / semantic classes.
- Custom Button variants preserved for auth/shells: `chrome`, `sidebarIcon`, `oauthGoogle`, `oauthApple`.

## Adding components

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add <component> --yes
```

Do not overwrite customized ui files without merging project-specific variants.

## Blocks

- Dashboard layouts: reference shadcn blocks (`sidebar-07`, `dashboard-01`) but wire to existing server data and nav configs in `components/layout/nav/portal-nav-config.ts`.

## Icons

- Dashboard nav: `@/lib/icons/client` wrappers are fine.
- shadcn block defaults may use Lucide — both libraries coexist during migration.
